        <span class="hero-badge">DATA ANALYST &amp; SOFTWARE ENGINEER</span>
        <p class="hero-greeting">Hello, I'm</p>
        <h1 class="hero-name">Ariani Dwi Septi</h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">Data-Driven Thinking with a Technical Mindset</p>
