        <p class="about-text">
          I am an Informatics graduate with practical experience in Data Analytics, along with supporting experience in Software Engineering and Software Testing. I process, analyze, and interpret data to generate insights that support decision-making processes.
        </p>
        
        <!-- Paragraf 2 -->
        <p class="about-text">
